12. The system, which is designed to manage artworks, sales and customers, should have 
methods to find artworks that match a specific request made by a customer.
For example, a customer may want to find all artworks by Sebastián Müller.
(a) State the initial value of noOfArtworks for an artist. [1]
(b) Construct the method sortArt() in the Artist class that will find the five most 
expensive artworks for a given artist.
You must make use of the selection sort algorithm. [5]
Artists must pay a 15 % commission to the shop for each of their artworks sold there.
The method commissionToPay calculates the commission to be paid by an artist on all 
sold artworks.
(c) Construct the method commissionToPay that will calculate and return the amount 
of commission to be paid by the artist to the shop. [6]
